{"version":1,"content":"<p>已故賭王兒子何猷君與內地超模奚夢瑤2019年在內地領證結婚，婚後育有一子Ronaldo和一女Romee，一家四口幸福滿瀉。</p><p>日前，Romee 5歲生，日獲父母舉行盛大派對慶祝，生日會以卡通和夢幻為主題，現場布置得相當精緻，猶如童話世界一樣。</p><p>生</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T16:24:31.733458+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T16:01:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:40.656028+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:40.656028+00:00","content_hash":"eff1163da26c915565acbb014513035add13d27d289ac969a8462e9300c938e9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}